<title>USA: BASEBALL-NATIONAL LEAGUE GOLD GLOVE AWARD WINNERS.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-NATIONAL LEAGUE GOLD GLOVE AWARD WINNERS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 1996 National League Gold</p>
<p>Glove Award winners for fielding excellence announced on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>First Base - Mark Grace, Chicago Cubs</p>
<p>Second Base - Craig Biggio, Houston Astros</p>
<p>Third Base - Ken Caminiti, San Diego Padres</p>
<p>Shortstop - Barry Larkin, Cincinnati Reds</p>
<p>Outfield - Barry Bonds, San Francisco Giants</p>
<p>Outfield - Marquis Grissom, Atlanta Braves</p>
<p>Outfield - Steve Finley, San Diego Padres</p>
<p>Catcher - Charles Johnson, Florida Marlins</p>
<p>Pitcher - Greg Maddux, Atlanta Braves</p>
</text>
